          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 147898,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Imagina un array como una barra de inventario. Un espacio puede almacenar cualquier variable o valor, ya sea un string, booleano o número como <code>100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 147899,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cada elemento en un array tiene una posición numerada llamada índice.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 147900,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Los índices comienzan en 0 y aumentan con cada valor adicional. Esto significa que el segundo elemento en <code>playerStats</code> está en el índice <code>1</code>. Codifica ese índice.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147901,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para acceder a un elemento como el valor <code>true</code>, escribe el nombre del array <code>playerStats</code> seguido del índice del elemento entre corchetes <code>[2]</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>playerStats</code> seguido de <code>[</code> y luego <code>2</code>, <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 147902,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para actualizar el valor en el segundo índice, accede a él a través de <code>playerStats[2]</code>, luego usa <code>=</code> para asignarle un nuevo valor como <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerStats[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>playerStats[2]</code> seguido de <code>=</code> y finalmente <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 147903,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A pesar de tener cuatro elementos en el array, el último índice al que podemos acceder es <code>3</code> porque la indexación comienza en 0.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerStats[\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;mage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 147904,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué tipos de valores puede almacenar un array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Cualquier valor, incluidos strings, números y booleans</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo cadenas</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Cualquier valor, incluidos strings, números y booleans.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 147905,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cómo llamamos a la posición de un elemento en un array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">El índice del elemento</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">El número del elemento</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">El índice del elemento.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 147906,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué índice tiene el elemento en este array?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 147907,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cómo accedemos a un elemento en este array?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" loot = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>loot[1]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>loot[\"gem\"]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>loot[1]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 147908,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cómo actualizamos un valor en un array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Accedemos al valor por su índice, luego asignamos otro valor</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No podemos actualizar valores en arrays</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Accedemos al valor por su índice, luego asignamos otro valor.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 147909,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿A qué índices podemos acceder en un array con dos elementos?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>0</code> y <code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code> y <code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>0</code> y <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 147910,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica el valor <code>false</code> en este array.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"32\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameOptions = [\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 147911,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Asegúrate de que <code>\"sword\"</code> esté en el índice <code>0</code>, y <code>\"shield\"</code> esté en el índice <code>1</code>, codificando <code>\"sword\"</code> y luego <code>\"shield\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;bow&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"36\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" equipment = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(equipment);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>\"sword\"</code> seguido de <code>\"shield\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 147912,
